    "examples": [
      "Use mcp__environment__execute for every AppWorld action. Put Python in its code parameter; never call apis.*, execute, or skill as separate tools. If a broad API listing is empty, call api_docs.show_api_doc for a specific candidate operation instead of repeating it.",
      "Before creating payment requests, read completed transaction history and exclude participants who already paid. Match participants and amounts; use create_transaction only when the request requires sending money.",
      "Before updating, disabling, or moving records, enumerate all matching evidence and resolve the exact affected set. Prefer in-place update or disable; use documented delete/create only when the app requires replacement, then verify exact removed, added, and unchanged records."
